## 📦 Dockerfiles I Wrote

### Flask App (Class 40)

```dockerfile
# Use lightweight Python image
FROM python:3.10-slim
# Set working directory
WORKDIR /app
# Copy files
COPY . .
# Install dependencies
RUN pip install -r requirements.txt
# Expose port
EXPOSE 8000
# Run the app
CMD ["python", "app.py"]
```

